                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just voted on legislation to repeal the COVID public heath emergency that Biden has renewed 12 times and eliminate the vaccine mandate on healthcare workers.\n\nThe American people deserve a government that\u2019s accountable to them, and the @HouseGOP majority is working to deliver.",
