                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Americans contribute to Medicare trust funds with the assurance they can count on those benefits. President Biden\u2019s proposed cuts would jeopardize care for millions of Americans.\n\nI will never support pulling the rug out from Americans that have relied on that promise.",
