                "text": "Many of our veterans return home with the invisible wounds sustained in their service for our country. That's why I joined @RepRyanZinke to introduce legislation to strengthen veterans access to mental healthcare services. Our brave heroes deserve access to the care they need. https://t.co/tE2cwp9539",
