                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Honored to receive the \u201cChampion of Healthcare Innovation\u201d award recently from @HealthInFocus. I will continue advocating for policies that get the government off the back of hardworking Americans, and empowers every American with access to high-quality, affordable healthcare. https://t.co/ayRgiH22xC",
