                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, I voted to pass the MILCON/VA Appropriations bill that supports our veterans by fully funding their benefits and healthcare. This bill also invests more into military bases and military construction than President Biden requested, all while cutting wasteful spending.",
