                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was honored to receive the \u201cGuardian of Seniors\u2019 Rights\u201d award from @60PlusAssoc recently. Social Security and Medicare are programs that represent a promise to all Americans. I am committed to protecting these programs and keeping our promise to seniors and all Americans. https://t.co/XMSN2Tsu20",
