                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Life is our most precious gift and valuable regardless of someone's disability or chronic illness. That\u2019s why I voted to pass H.R. 485, a bill that protects veterans and Americans covered by federal healthcare programs from being denied care due to their disability or illness. https://t.co/1lPoVBD41d",
