                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The @POTUS understands how seniors - many which live in my district - have paid into and now rely on Medicare and Social Security. We share a commitment to not pulling the rug out from under these Americans. @HouseGOP bill protects these benefits.",
